# --- legacy WP content that will NOT exist on the new host (added 2026-07-02) ---
# Live still serves these 200 with traffic; after cutover they would 404.
# Adult help pages get more specific 301s to the cam-guides domain when it ships —
# that block must be pasted ABOVE this catch-all.
# (?!index\.html$) — the slashless RewriteRule internally rewrites /help -> /help/index.html;
# without the exclusion this catch-all re-catches it and loops /help onto itself
